    </?01M0QXZ1CZY4SBE1HTGB36MABM>
    <decision-text ?01M0QXZ1CZY4SBE1HTGB36MABN>
    Kind=`HolonExecutionBinding`，FQN=`Eidolon.AI.KindDefinition.HolonExecutionBinding`，apiVersion=`eidolon.ai/v1`，KindDefinition version=`1.0.0`；公共 `holarchy-eidolon-adapter` 拥有 contract bytes 与 projection/freeze，私有 @cell 包只做兼容 re-export 和产品接线。
    </?01M0QXZ1CZY4SBE1HTGB36MABN>
