<decision #mission.local_file_single_node_holon_task_actor_runtime.task_space_package_boundary apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01M0QXZ3DJARKDDNWXEPQYT9SG>
  TaskSpace kernel 与各领域 profile 如何划分 package？
  </?01M0QXZ3DJARKDDNWXEPQYT9SG>
  <answer (
    <raw-answer ?01M0QXZ3DK701X4TV7S8FZN6XT>
    采用共享 TaskSpace kernel、不同领域 profile；Codument TaskSpace 明确跳过。
    </?01M0QXZ3DK701X4TV7S8FZN6XT>
    <decision-text ?01M0QXZ3DK701X4TV7S8FZN6XV>
    task-manager-contract 只放 closed data/ports；task-manager-logic 放纯/runtime-first processors；新 task-manager-file-support 放 Node FS transaction。kernel lifecycle 精确为 Pending|Ready|Claimed|Running|Waiting|Succeeded|Failed|Cancelled，并拥有 claim lease/heartbeat/expiry/history；BP 词汇与 ai-workflow 组织字段分别留在 profile，Ctrl/Data 只做 adapters。
    </?01M0QXZ3DK701X4TV7S8FZN6XV>
    <rationale ?01M0QXZ3DK701X4TV7S8FZN6XW>
    共享任务生命期与并发语义，同时允许人工业务任务和 AI 组织任务拥有不同字段，不让 FS effect 污染 kernel。
    </?01M0QXZ3DK701X4TV7S8FZN6XW>
    <evidence ?01M0QXZ3DK701X4TV7S8FZN6XX>
    用户确认；depa-flows task-manager-*、bp-ctrl-flow-* 与 AI Workflow package actual state。
    </?01M0QXZ3DK701X4TV7S8FZN6XX>
  )>
