  </?01M18JYQXYJK8NCR4RG9H4XJN4>
)>

<decision #mission.local_file_single_node_holon_task_actor_runtime.file_authority_protocol apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01M0QXZ4M6GR2ZQ39NFZYPN0R3>
  Mission 1 本地文件 authority 的物理布局与 transaction protocol 是什么？
  </?01M0QXZ4M6GR2ZQ39NFZYPN0R3>
  <answer (
    <raw-answer ?01M0QXZ4M6GR2ZQ39NFZYPN0R4>
    采用 content-addressed records/trees/receipts + recoverable journal + head-last CAS；Flow 保持 Definition→Instance→Run，TaskSpace 位于 run 下。
    </?01M0QXZ4M6GR2ZQ39NFZYPN0R4>
    <decision-text ?01M0QXZ4M6GR2ZQ39NFZYPN0R5>
    Holon authority 使用 head/records/trees/receipts/transactions；Eidolon 使用 holon-deployments/&lt;deployment&gt;/definition+runtime；Flow 使用 instances/&lt;instance&gt;/runs/&lt;run&gt;/checkpoint、step-space、task-spaces。每个 owner 做 closed normalize、containment、recoverable lock、CAS、file+parent fsync、journal、head-last rename 和 readback。
    </?01M0QXZ4M6GR2ZQ39NFZYPN0R5>
    <rationale ?01M0QXZ4M6GR2ZQ39NFZYPN0R6>
    内容寻址和 head-last admission 提供可恢复单 owner authority；跨 owner 用 durable receipt + CAS，而不伪造文件系统全局事务。
    </?01M0QXZ4M6GR2ZQ39NFZYPN0R6>
    <evidence ?01M0QXZ4M6GR2ZQ39NFZYPN0R7>
    用户本轮接受建议；depa-flows canonical Definition→Instance→Run 与 StepSpace transaction 经验。
    </?01M0QXZ4M6GR2ZQ39NFZYPN0R7>
  )>
  <confidence ?01M18JYQXYJK8NCR4RG9H4XJN5>
  high
  </?01M18JYQXYJK8NCR4RG9H4XJN5>
  <reversibility ?01M18JYQXYJK8NCR4RG9H4XJN6>
  hard
  </?01M18JYQXYJK8NCR4RG9H4XJN6>
)>

<decision #mission.local_file_single_node_holon_task_actor_runtime.snapshot_artifact_authority apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMYX>
  Holon effective snapshot 怎样跨项目进入 ResourcePackage、deployment 与 TaskSpace，而不形成三份可写真源？
  </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMYX>
  <answer (
    <raw-answer ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMYY>
    由 Holon Workbench 签发一个中立、可携带的 exact snapshot Resource/receipt；Eidolon 与 TaskSpace 只冻结并引用该签发物。
    </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMYY>
    <decision-text ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMYZ>
    Holon Workbench owns Kind `HolonEffectiveSnapshot`, FQN `Holon.Workbench.KindDefinition.HolonEffectiveSnapshot`, apiVersion `holon.workbench/v1`, definition version `1.0.0`; holarchy-core-contract owns the closed contract and canonical KindDefinition bytes, while holarchy-core-logic projects/exports the canonical snapshot and issuance receipt. ResourcePackage/deployment mechanically retain those bytes and receipt. TaskSpace derives a HolonTaskSnapshotReceipt that references their digest plus the frozen execution-binding digest.
    </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMYZ>
    <rationale ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZ0>
    A portable issuer-owned artifact closes provenance and recovery without letting Eidolon or TaskSpace re-author organization master data.
    </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZ0>
    <evidence ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZ1>
    Stored architecture authority map identifies Holon Workbench as snapshot issuer and HolonTaskSnapshotReceipt as each TaskSpace's organization-version fact.
    </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZ1>
  )>
  <confidence ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZ2>
  high
  </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZ2>
  <reversibility ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZ3>
  hard
  </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZ3>
)>

<decision #mission.local_file_single_node_holon_task_actor_runtime.holarchy_package_roles apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZ4>
  Holarchy libraries, Workbench applications and cross-project adapters use which package identity grammar and ownership rule?
  </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZ4>
  <answer (
    <raw-answer ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZ5>
    Role is always the final token and only contract, logic, support, adapter or capsule are allowed; composer is the retired early capsule name. Adapters live where the wrapping integration is implemented.
    </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZ5>
    <decision-text ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZ6>
    Public packages use `<family>-<capability-path>-<role>` with final role exactly `contract|logic|support|adapter|capsule`. Holon Workbench publishes only substantive Holarchy libraries; its server/web are private apps. Holon Workbench owns holarchy-depa-domain-adapter, while eidolon-anchor owns holarchy-eidolon-adapter. The public closures are released only by the repository that owns each adapter; private product packages are never published.
    </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZ6>
    <rationale ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZ7>
    The grammar makes package responsibilities mechanically reviewable, prevents upper applications from leaking into the release closure, and places protocol translation with the actual integrator.
    </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZ7>
    <evidence ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZ8>
    User decisions on 2026-08-24; Replan 003; existing DEPA contract/logic/support/composition experience.
    </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZ8>
  )>
  <confidence ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZ9>
  high
  </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZ9>
  <reversibility ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZA>
  moderate
  </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZA>
)>

<decision #mission.local_file_single_node_holon_task_actor_runtime.holon_runtime_coordination apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZB>
  谁根据冻结组织与 ready TaskSpace 选择 MemberRuntime 并协调 assignment？
  </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZB>
  <answer (
    <raw-answer ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZC>
    Eidolon deployment 必须为每个 Holon 提供长期 HolonRuntime/HolonCoordinatorActor；不能让 workflow 预选 Member 绕过组织运行。
    </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZC>
    <decision-text ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZD>
    One shared HolonRuntime/HolonCoordinatorActor per `(deploymentId, holonRef)` observes TaskSpace-ready facts, evaluates frozen Role/Policy plus HolonExecutionBinding, proposes a typed assignment command and resolves the selected stable MemberRuntimeRef. TaskSpace remains assignment/claim/result authority; the coordinator retains only subscriptions, actor refs, cursor, pending correlations, supervision and health observations.
    </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZD>
    <rationale ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZE>
    Holon target semantics require an organization-level runtime owner, while task facts and organization master data must remain in their existing authorities.
    </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZE>
