<decision #mission.local_file_single_node_holon_task_actor_runtime.execution_adapter_union apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZJ>
  HolonExecutionBinding 如何在人机中立的主数据上表达不同运行载体？
  </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZJ>
  <answer (
    <raw-answer ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZK>
    使用 Eidolon-owned closed adapter union，不用 principalKind 自动路由。
    </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZK>
    <decision-text ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZM>
    HolonMemberExecutionAdapter 精确为 ai-agent、human-endpoint、service、hybrid。各分支只引用冻结 Resource；hybrid 只在冻结 candidates 内按 policy 选择；TaskSpace 与 Coordinator 共用同一 task/claim/invocation/result envelope。
    </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZM>
    <rationale ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZN>
    组织主数据保持中立，业务执行仍可精确版本化，而且任务协议不因执行主体类型分叉。
    </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZN>
    <evidence ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZP>
    docs/ai/architecture/holon-task-actor-system.md MemberRuntime 形态与本 Mission neutrality decision。
    </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZP>
  )>
