  high
  </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZQ>
  <reversibility ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZR>
  moderate
  </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZR>
)>

<decision #mission.local_file_single_node_holon_task_actor_runtime.member_session_scope apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZS>
  默认长期 MemberRuntime 是否同时意味着所有任务共享一个 conversation/session？
  </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZS>
  <answer (
    <raw-answer ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZT>
    不意味着。默认按 task claim attempt 建 durable session；跨调用复用必须显式 targeted。
    </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZT>
    <decision-text ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZV>
    MemberRuntime address 默认按 deployment/member 复用；conversation 默认按 taskSpace/task/claim/attempt 隔离。只有冻结 binding 授权的 runTargetedAgent 且 selector 精确为 {byId} 或 {byName} 时才能复用既有 Agent instance；旧的 instance-prefixed keys fail closed。
    </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZV>
    <rationale ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZW>
    将 actor continuity 与 conversation scope 分开，既保留长期成员身份，也阻断无意的跨任务上下文泄漏。
    </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZW>
    <evidence ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZX>
    现有 runAgent/runTargetedAgent contract、generic actor/session authority 与 Mission risk analysis。
    </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZX>
  )>
  <confidence ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZY>
  high
  </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZY>
  <reversibility ?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZZ>
  moderate
  </?01M18JYQXZ2V59PPRDKJJ6NMZZ>
)>
